<item><title>Guinean court jails 22 former Siguiri officials and 202 illegal gold miners</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/gn/guinean-court-jails-22-former-siguiri-officials-and-202-71bcf3/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/gn/guinean-court-jails-22-former-siguiri-officials-and-202-71bcf3/</guid><category>Guinea</category><description>The former territorial administrators were sentenced to two years each for environmental damage, while the miners face three years and a 10 billion franc fine.</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 19:49:09 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/gn/guinean-court-jails-22-former-siguiri-officials-and-202-71bcf3/share.jpg" length="45635" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/gn/guinean-court-jails-22-former-siguiri-officials-and-202-71bcf3/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>18 African countries meet in Conakry on extending social protection</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/gn/18-african-countries-meet-in-conakry-on-extending-social-0aa894/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/gn/18-african-countries-meet-in-conakry-on-extending-social-0aa894/</guid><category>Guinea</category><description>The four-day seminar, organised by the Conférence interafricaine de la prévoyance sociale (CIPRES), brings delegations from 18 African countries together.</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 18:43:45 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/gn.jpg" length="31286" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/gn.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Guinea beats Eritrea 3-1 in Cairo to take provisional lead in Group D</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/gn/guinea-beats-eritrea-3-1-in-cairo-to-take-provisional-lead-df580d/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/gn/guinea-beats-eritrea-3-1-in-cairo-to-take-provisional-lead-df580d/</guid><category>Guinea</category><description>Guinea&apos;s Syli National moved provisionally to the top of Group D with nine points after four matchdays of the 2027 Africa Cup of Nations qualifiers.</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 18:17:38 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/gn.jpg" length="31286" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/gn.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Guinea court adjourns trial of prison guard over hospital inmate escape</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/gn/guinea-court-adjourns-trial-of-prison-guard-over-hospital-93c623/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/gn/guinea-court-adjourns-trial-of-prison-guard-over-hospital-93c623/</guid><category>Guinea</category><description>The Dixinn court postponed the case to 30 November after the prosecution asked for more time to investigate the escape.</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 17:34:57 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/gn.jpg" length="31286" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/gn.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
